{"version":1,"key":"card:590","content":{"id":590,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"IP 作为识别用户的缺点：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ed3b4ad3-dc42-45ee-9e45-80f47d8cd86a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"IP 是和机器绑定而不是和用户绑定的，如果一台机器上允许多个用户登录，则无法识别","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"77087e9a-06cc-450a-95d0-3db306282e53","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"32d7afa6-286b-423e-802f-8eb6211bfe79","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"在有的场景下，每次用户登录，网管都会分配新的 IP 地址","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ce6e9c66-55dd-4f28-a9cf-7750ecc0cda5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7958ed07-cff8-4e33-9cac-87cc53b1d8d0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"出于安全性以及 IP 地址资源的紧缺性的考虑，大多数用户都通过 NAT 与外部互联网连接，使用的都是 NAT 的公网 IP，无法获取到用户的真实 IP","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c62d8859-675b-463f-9467-45de8a72dc80","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c46b8039-1f2c-4584-b6a8-43fcbec36361","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"在客户和服务器之间存在代理，服务器与代理连接而不是与客户端连接，虽然存在 Client-IP 和 X-Forward-For 请求头来传递源 IP 地址，但是不一定所有的代理都支持","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bd5bc65a-2afe-475c-a35e-d884f10cf66e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"65dc03d8-e8de-4db9-a4c4-c20210838b2b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"ef52ecca-832c-42ed-a30d-ea915440986f","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["网络","用户认证","HTTP"],"createTime":1752457481555,"updateTime":1793532563568,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532563568}}